From bd07aa3133fccd6c6a025ddb9a35a4a629d5ad4f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Link Dupont <link@sub-pop.net>
Date: Thu, 14 Aug 2025 14:01:34 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] CustomServerObjectHandler

Add a custom ServerObjectHandler subclass that overrides _method_callback and _handle_call. This custom subclass captures the sender information from the invocation and stores it in a thread-local context manager. Handler methods can then use the get_current_sender method from the sender_context to retrieve the sender value.
---
